"""Règles de qualité : (id, dimension, table, description, gravité, traitement, requête de comptage).
Chaque requête renvoie le NOMBRE DE LIGNES EN ANOMALIE sur la couche préparation (avant traitement)."""

# gravité : BLOQUANTE (la ligne est écartée), MAJEURE (impact sur les indicateurs), MINEURE (information)
RULES = [
 ("C01","Complétude","clients","Date de naissance manquante","MINEURE","Signaler (âge inconnu, tranche 'INCONNU')",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.clients WHERE date_naissance_raw IS NULL"),
 ("C02","Complétude","contrats","Champ obligatoire manquant (produit, date d'effet, prime)","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE produit IS NULL OR date_effet IS NULL OR prime_annuelle IS NULL"),
 ("C03","Complétude","contrats","Champ propre au produit manquant (AUTO sans bonus-malus/puissance, HABITATION sans surface)","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE (produit='AUTO' AND (bonus_malus IS NULL OR puissance_cv IS NULL)) OR (produit='HABITATION' AND surface_m2 IS NULL)"),
 ("C04","Complétude","sinistres","Champ obligatoire manquant (dates, garantie, statut)","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres WHERE date_survenance IS NULL OR date_declaration IS NULL OR garantie IS NULL OR statut IS NULL"),
 ("U01","Unicité","clients","client_id dupliqué","BLOQUANTE","Exclure",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) - COUNT(DISTINCT client_id) FROM prep.clients"),
 ("U02","Unicité","clients","Même client présent plusieurs fois (email_hash identique)","MAJEURE","Fusionner : garder le plus petit client_id, alias dans core.client_alias",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.clients WHERE rang_email > 1"),
 ("U03","Unicité","contrats","contrat_id dupliqué","BLOQUANTE","Exclure",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) - COUNT(DISTINCT contrat_id) FROM prep.contrats"),
 ("U04","Unicité","reglements","Paiement livré plusieurs fois (paiement_id identique)","MAJEURE","Exclure la re-livraison (quarantaine), garder la première",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements WHERE rang_occ > 1"),
 ("U05","Unicité","sinistres","sinistre_id dupliqué","BLOQUANTE","Exclure",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) - COUNT(DISTINCT sinistre_id) FROM prep.sinistres"),
 ("U06","Unicité","clients","Paire de doublons dont la date de naissance ou la région diffère (valide la clé email_hash)","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT email_hash FROM prep.clients GROUP BY 1 HAVING COUNT(*)>1 AND (COUNT(DISTINCT date_naissance_raw)>1 OR COUNT(DISTINCT region)>1))"),
 ("V01","Validité","clients","Date de naissance factice 01/01/1890","MINEURE","Corriger : mise à NULL",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.clients WHERE date_naissance_raw = '01/01/1890'"),
 ("V02","Validité","clients","Titulaire mineur à la date d'extraction","MINEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.clients WHERE date_naissance > DATE '${EXTRACT_DATE}' - INTERVAL 18 YEAR"),
 ("V03","Validité","contrats","Prime annuelle nulle ou négative","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine) + sinistres rattachés",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE prime_annuelle <= 0 OR prime_annuelle IS NULL"),
 ("V04","Validité","reglements","Montant nul, négatif ou illisible","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements WHERE rang_occ = 1 AND (montant IS NULL OR montant <= 0)"),
 ("V05","Validité","contrats","Champs incohérents avec le produit (AUTO avec surface, HABITATION avec puissance/bonus-malus)","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE (produit='AUTO' AND surface_m2 IS NOT NULL) OR (produit='HABITATION' AND (puissance_cv IS NOT NULL OR bonus_malus IS NOT NULL))"),
 ("V06","Validité","contrats","Bonus-malus hors de [0,50 ; 3,50]","MINEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE bonus_malus < 0.5 OR bonus_malus > 3.5"),
 ("V07","Validité","reglements","Sinistre dont le cumul payé dépasse 500 000 EUR (valeur extrême)","MAJEURE","Signaler ; analysé à part (queue de distribution)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT sinistre_id FROM prep.reglements WHERE rang_occ=1 GROUP BY 1 HAVING SUM(montant) > 500000)"),
 ("V08","Validité","sinistres","Garantie incompatible avec le produit du contrat","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres s JOIN prep.contrats c USING (contrat_id) WHERE (c.produit='AUTO' AND s.garantie IN ('DEGAT_EAUX','INCENDIE','TEMPETE')) OR (c.produit='HABITATION' AND s.garantie IN ('COLLISION','RC','BRIS_GLACE'))"),
 ("V09","Validité","toutes","Valeur hors référentiel (statut, produit, zone 1-5, formule, canal)","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres WHERE statut NOT IN ('CLOTURE','OUVERT','REJETE','SANS_SUITE')) + (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE produit NOT IN ('AUTO','HABITATION') OR zone_risque NOT BETWEEN 1 AND 5 OR formule NOT IN ('ESSENTIELLE','CONFORT','PREMIUM') OR canal_distribution NOT IN ('WEB','AGENT','COURTIER'))"),
 ("R01","Cohérence inter-tables","contrats","Client référencé absent du CRM","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE client_id NOT IN (SELECT client_id FROM prep.clients)"),
 ("R02","Cohérence inter-tables","sinistres","Contrat référencé absent","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine, règle P01)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres WHERE contrat_id NOT IN (SELECT contrat_id FROM prep.contrats)"),
 ("R03","Cohérence inter-tables","reglements","Sinistre référencé absent","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine, règle P02)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements WHERE rang_occ=1 AND sinistre_id NOT IN (SELECT sinistre_id FROM prep.sinistres)"),
 ("R04","Cohérence inter-tables","audits","Sinistre audité absent","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine, règle P03)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.audits WHERE sinistre_id NOT IN (SELECT sinistre_id FROM prep.sinistres)"),
 ("K01","Cohérence métier","reglements","Paiement sur un sinistre REJETE ou SANS_SUITE","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements r JOIN prep.sinistres s USING (sinistre_id) WHERE r.rang_occ=1 AND s.statut IN ('REJETE','SANS_SUITE')"),
 ("K02","Cohérence métier","sinistres","Réserve incohérente avec le statut (CLOTURE/OUVERT à 0, REJETE/SANS_SUITE > 0)","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres WHERE (statut IN ('CLOTURE','OUVERT') AND reserve_initiale = 0) OR (statut IN ('REJETE','SANS_SUITE') AND reserve_initiale > 0)"),
 ("K03","Cohérence métier","audits","Audit sur un sinistre OUVERT ou SANS_SUITE","MINEURE","Signaler (conservé, population précisée dans l'analyse)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.audits a JOIN prep.sinistres s USING (sinistre_id) WHERE s.statut IN ('OUVERT','SANS_SUITE')"),
 ("K04","Cohérence métier","sinistres","Sinistre CLOTURE sans aucun règlement","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres s WHERE statut='CLOTURE' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM prep.reglements r WHERE r.sinistre_id=s.sinistre_id)"),
 ("T01","Cohérence temporelle","contrats","Résiliation antérieure à la date d'effet","BLOQUANTE","Exclure (quarantaine) + sinistres rattachés",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE date_resiliation < date_effet"),
 ("T02","Cohérence temporelle","contrats","Résiliation le jour de l'effet (couverture nulle)","MINEURE","Signaler (aucune ligne d'exposition générée)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE date_resiliation = date_effet"),
 ("T03","Cohérence temporelle","sinistres","Déclaration antérieure à la survenance","MAJEURE","Signaler ; délai de déclaration non calculé",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres WHERE date_declaration < date_survenance"),
 ("T04","Cohérence temporelle","sinistres","Survenance avant la date d'effet du contrat","MAJEURE","Signaler (drapeau anomalie_hors_couverture)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres s JOIN prep.contrats c USING (contrat_id) WHERE s.date_survenance < c.date_effet"),
 ("T05","Cohérence temporelle","sinistres","Survenance après la résiliation du contrat","MAJEURE","Signaler (drapeau anomalie_hors_couverture)",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres s JOIN prep.contrats c USING (contrat_id) WHERE c.date_resiliation IS NOT NULL AND s.date_survenance >= c.date_resiliation"),
 ("T06","Cohérence temporelle","reglements","Paiement antérieur à la déclaration du sinistre","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements r JOIN prep.sinistres s USING (sinistre_id) WHERE r.rang_occ=1 AND r.date_paiement < s.date_declaration"),
 ("T07","Cohérence temporelle","toutes","Date postérieure à l'extraction du 30/06/2025","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements WHERE date_paiement > DATE '${EXTRACT_DATE}') + (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.sinistres WHERE date_declaration > DATE '${EXTRACT_DATE}') + (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.contrats WHERE date_effet > DATE '${EXTRACT_DATE}')"),
 ("T08","Cohérence temporelle","reglements","Fichier mensuel contenant un paiement d'un autre mois (livraison tardive ou re-livraison)","MINEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.reglements WHERE mois_fichier <> mois_paiement"),
 ("T09","Cohérence temporelle","audits","Audit antérieur à la déclaration du sinistre","MAJEURE","Signaler",
  "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM prep.audits a JOIN prep.sinistres s USING (sinistre_id) WHERE a.date_audit < s.date_declaration"),
]
